# Context Engineering Autorun (modo B)

## Lei (todos os chats — espelho do hook global)

1. **Status (1 linha):** `Autorun ativo: prompt-engineering + context-engineering (B, economia tokens).`
2. **Hook:** `~/.cursor/hooks/prompt-skills-autorun.js` + `~/.cursor/hooks/repos-cursor-guard.js`
3. **Skills root:** `C:\inteligencia-artificial\.cursor\skills\` (junction → `repos-cursor\.cursor\skills`)
4. **Sync:** `C:\inteligencia-artificial\bin\sync-context-engineering-skills.cmd`
5. **Ops Cursor:** sempre `C:\inteligencia-artificial\repos-cursor\` (`cursor-ops-repos-cursor.mdc`)

## Modo B — nucleo + router + on-demand

### Nucleo (sintese sempre ativa — SKILL.md completo so sob demanda)

| Skill | Comportamento autorun |
|---|---|
| `context-fundamentals` | Contexto = orcamento de atencao; qualidade > quantidade |
| `context-optimization` | Respostas concisas, masking, compaction >70%, prefix estavel |
| `filesystem-context` | Offload grande para arquivo em `C:\inteligencia-artificial\<projeto>\` |

### Router (17 skills — ler `SKILL.md` completo quando gatilho bater)

Paths: `C:\inteligencia-artificial\.cursor\skills\<nome>\SKILL.md`

- `context-degradation` — lost-in-middle, poisoning, degradacao
- `context-compression` — reduzir trajectory sob pressao
- `latent-briefing` — KV cache entre orchestrator/workers
- `multi-agent-patterns` — coordenacao, handoffs, paralelo
- `long-horizon-prompting` — agente autonomo longo
- `memory-systems` — memoria cross-session
- `tool-design` — contratos e descricoes de tools
- `hosted-agents` — sandboxes remotos
- `evaluation` — checks e rubricas
- `advanced-evaluation` — LLM-as-judge
- `harness-engineering` — loops autonomos
- `self-improvement-loops` — RSI, meta-harness
- `project-development` — task-model fit, pipelines
- `bdi-mental-states` — beliefs/desires/intentions

## Proibido no autorun

- Carregar corpo completo das 17 skills em todo chat
- `enhance-prompt` (somente Stitch)

## Exemplos

```
✅ Chat curto codigo: sintese nucleo + prompt-engineering
✅ Sessao longa: ler context-degradation + context-compression on-demand
✅ Output grande: salvar arquivo + referencia (filesystem-context)
❌ Ler 17 SKILL.md inteiros no boot
❌ enhance-prompt em chat de ops
```
